# A new workspace from the rail's ＋ (sfpages workspace.mbt), two accounts signed in: named, its account picked
# among them.
timeout 20000
until 整理发布清单
wait 300
move 28 656
wait 300
tapxy 28 656
wait 700
tap 新建 workspace
wait 1200
type 设计组
wait 700
tap lin@example.com
wait 1200
tap lin@work.example
wait 1500
